  "verdict": "revise",
  "issues": [
    "GROUNDING: The draft answer cites specific conversion rates and differences that do not appear in any of the printed outputs.",
    "OVERREACH: The conclusion attributes campaign success (or failure) to the email channel despite the channel not being randomly assigned and only adjusting for customer_segment; other confounders remain unaddressed.",
    "UNACKNOWLEDGED DATA PROBLEMS: Refunded orders (85 rows) are included in the conversion calculation, which can inflate conversion rates, yet the analyst does not exclude or discuss them.",
    "SCOPE: The answer assumes success is defined solely by conversion rates without confirming that this matches the contract’s definition of campaign success."
  ]
}
